  "summary": "Replaces directory-level `include_directories` with `target_include_directories` in the source build configuration. Also links `bitcoin_ipc` against `core_interface` to ensure IPC translation units inherit project-wide compiler flags.",
  "problem": "CMake 4.5.0 triggers `-Wnon-target-directive` warnings on directory-scoped commands like `include_directories`, which are not caught by the repository's custom CMake checks in the `src/` directory. In addition, `ipc/stub.cpp` was being compiled without project-wide build flags due to missing linkage to `core_interface`.",
